sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Customer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>FavouritesPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewFavouritesBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewFavouritesController
  participant Favourite as «entity»<br/>Favourite
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: view my favourite list
  UI->>B: GET /api/customer/favourites (JWT)
  B->>C: list(Integer customerId, Pageable pageable)
  C->>Favourite: findVisibleForCustomer()
  Favourite->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Favourite: rows
  Favourite-->>C: result
  C-->>B: PageResponse<ProjectCard>
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result